{title: For the Beauty of the Earth}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: tune DIX}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]For the [G]beauty [F]of the [C]earth, [F]for the [C]glory [G]of the [C]skies
[C]For the [G]love which [F]from our [C]birth [F]over [C]and a[G]round us [C]lies.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Lord of [Am]all to [G]Thee we [C]raise, [F]this our [C]hymn of [G]grateful [C]praise.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]For the [G]wonder [F]of each [C]hour, [F]of the [C]day and [G]of the [C]night
[C]Hill and [G]vale, and [F]tree and [C]flower, [F]sun and [C]moon, and [G]stars of [C]light.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]For the [G]joy of [F]human [C]love, [F]brother, [C]sister, [G]parent, [C]child
[C]Friends on [G]earth and [F]friends a[C]bove, [F]for all [C]gentle [G]thoughts and [C]mild.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]For the [G]church, [F]that e[C]vermore, [F]lifteth [C]holy [G]hands a[C]bove
[C]Offering [G]up on [F]every [C]shore [F]her pure [C]sacri[G]fice of [C]love.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[C]For Thy[G]self, best [F]Gift Di[C]vine, [F]to our [C]race so [G]freely [C]given
[C]For that [G]great great [F]love of [C]Thine, [F]peace on [C]earth and [G]joy in [C]Heaven.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
